tscenes instead of Harry, but that's a very small thing. Highly recommended.", "timestamp_created": 1751171233, "timestamp_updated": 1751171233, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "198377445", "author": {"steamid": "76561198038918113", "personaname": "Blackheart", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198038918113/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 55, "playtime_forever": 2835, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 545, "last_played": 1781529888, "avatar": "2ba884d13ce98ac498af7b224821b4782f393897"}, "language": "english", "review": "Quick and dirty flip of the assets made for SE5, but packaged as a separate, stand-alone game due to dwindling interest in any more SE5 DLC among the core audience — with the added bonus of scamming another chunk of Gamepass royalites out of Microsoft!\n\nThe stand-alone nature of SER also needlessly splits the Invasion gamemode population, between two functionally identical titles.\n\nAs well as their increasingly scummy monetisation model, the addition of the timed Resistance Mode — with game content locked behind it's completion — and a marketing campaign focusing on casual 'Run and gun' gameplay shows that Rebellion has nothing but contempt for the series' longtime audience.\n\nSadly, most Sniper Elite players seems to think a full priced serving of re-heated SE5 leftovers is better than nothing, and have generally defended this ♥♥♥♥♥♥ offering.", "timestamp_created": 1751129117, "timestamp_updated": 1751181819, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 78, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.748201549053192139", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 6, "count": 3}, {"reaction_type": 19, "count": 2}, {"reaction_type": 5, "count": 2}, {"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}]}]}